  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.mariner.line1": "Ahoy there matey, I'm looking for a treasure chest buried along these here shores. Bring me the trident hidden there, and I'll make it worth your while.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.mariner.line2": "That trident has seen better days, but it may still serve you well. What we need is a magic book. See what them pirates have got hidden away.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.mariner.line3": "If you really want an adventure, there be an old rumor of a hidden chamber under the waves. You might find a chart in the old room beneath the monument.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.mariner.line4": "The map! You found her! By Neptune's Beard... I hope you know what you're doing, sailor.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.mariner.line5": "A Heavy Core... so the old bosun's tales were true after all. A dangerous weapon this could make. Perhaps some things are better left beneath the sea.",

  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.archeologist.line1": "Greetings traveller. I am seeking an ancient tablet depicting the layout of a great city. Search the ruins and see what you can find.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.archeologist.line2": "I've heard rumours about that place... We'd better be able to tread very quietly. Go to the desert and find this ancient tome.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.archeologist.line3": "There may be more clues hidden in the ancient temples of the rainforest - take this map and see what you can find.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.archeologist.line4": "So the city really does exist. Follow the map and see what secrets have survived within its ruins. But... step carefully my friend.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.archeologist.line5": "So, you've recovered a shard from those that came before. You know, they say the power of life after death lies within.",

  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.ranger.line1": "There's an outlaws cave somewhere in these badlands. If you wanna help kid, you can see one of these here banners.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.ranger.line2": "As I figured, this ain't no gang of common outlaws. If you're gonna help, you're gonna need a disguise. See what you can find in the old trapper's lodge.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.ranger.line3": "Now if only we knew the way to their hideout in the woods. The pillagers must know - see if they have a map. You might wanna put on that trim first.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.ranger.line4": "Well, good luck. If you make it back with this here totem, I'll know you've done the job.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.ranger.line5": "Not bad kid... you can keep that...",

  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.priest.line1": "There's something unnatural in these lands... the darkness is leaking through. If only I could find some evidence.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.priest.line2": "The only way to know more is to go the dark lands beneath. You must go through the gate and find the temple of bones. But wear gold!",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.priest.line3": "One of the old gods... fascinating. The old texts describe a ritual using soul sand and the skulls of three dark skeletons. See if the pigs have a map.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.priest.line4": "I must see this skull. I need to know if the stories are more than just stories.",
  "message.terrainlab.trail_trader.priest.line5": "The final ingredient... fascinating. Of course, only a fool or a mad man would actually try it.",

